{{!--
    File: ScanPOCs.hbs
    Purpose: This file contains the Handlebars template for displaying artifact records.
             Specifically, this is the intersection table between Points Of Contact and 3D Scans to highlight the M:M relationship between them.
    Author: Aspen Frazee and Alexander Hinson
    Created: 02-06-2026
    Last Update: 03-15-2026
    AI USAGE:
    Ai was used to help dispay the table better. This included having to change to hard coded column names, and changing
    the text style of the email that's listed after the point of contact name. This is additionally where
    the implementation for the icons is, that was used to clean up the UI and make it easier to navigate.
--}}
<h1>Scan'douts List</h1>
<div class="Description">
<p>The intersection table between Points Of Contact and 3D Scans to highlight the M:M relationship between them.<br> 
Specifically regarding the points of contact after the lab point of contact involving the 3d scans, where someone can<br>
request a 3D scan file as a loan. These are also called scan handouts, or: scan'douts!</p>
</div>

{{! READ table }}
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      {{! We had to switch to manual headers so that we could display two attributes 
      under the same column without adding another unimportant unwanted column to the table}}
        <th>ID</th>
        <th>File Name</th>
        <th>Contact</th>
        <th>
          <a href="/ScanPOCs/Create" class="btn btn-primary">+ New Scan'dout</a>
        </th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{#each scancontacts}}
      <tr>
        <td>{{this.ID}}</td>
        <td>{{this.File}}</td>
        <td>
          {{this.Name}}<br>
          <span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
          {{this.Contact}}
          </span>
        </td>
        <td>
          <div class="action-buttons">

            <a href="/ScanPOCs/Update/{{this.ID}}" class="btn btn-secondary btn-icon">
              <i class="bi bi-pencil"></i>
            </a>

            <form method="POST" action="/DeleteScanPOC" style="display:inline;">
              <input type="hidden" name="scanPOCID" value="{{this.ID}}">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger btn-icon">
                <i class="bi bi-trash"></i>
              </button>
            </form>

          </div>
        </td>


      </tr>
    {{/each}}
  </tbody>
</table>
